Rāma preaches fate time and orders next rites --- Lakṣmaṇa orders Vālin cremation with Tārā and Aṅgada --- Lakṣmaṇa orders sandalwood bier supplies and consoling Aṅgada --- Minister Tāra fetches bier carried by heroes --- Sugrīva garlands and lifts Vālin onto jeweled bier --- Funeral procession displays royal pomp with wailing kin --- Bearers build pyre on secluded river bank --- Tārā cradles head lamenting Rāma-time widowing wives --- Aṅgada and Sugrīva place father on pyre and light fire --- Monkeys bathe and offer water as Rāma shares grief
